data: {"id": "28affe740d654a93-thinking-parallel_evidence-782", "run_id": "28affe740d654a93", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，根据 baseline 结果，Prometheus 和日志/追踪已有初步证据。Prometheus 显示 pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，最后终止原因为 Error。日志中大量出现 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误。Tracing 显示多个 HTTP GET /work 请求返回 500，且 Tempo span 中有 `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit` 属性。\n\n接下来执行 kubectl describe pod、previous logs 和 events 来获取 Last State 详细信息，确证是否为 ConfigError 导致的 CrashLoopBackOff。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788445808991, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

